WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.250 --> 00:00:05.401
Let us build kinetic identity as a coherent visual system.

2
00:00:05.401 --> 00:00:13.130
Start with composition and reusable components, then move into motion, materials, and controlled variation.

3
00:00:13.530 --> 00:00:19.449
In After Effects, shape the rhythm with keyframes, expressions, and the graph editor.

4
00:00:19.449 --> 00:00:26.621
In Cinema 4D, connect the cloner, materials, lighting, and camera so the visual system stays coherent.

5
00:00:27.021 --> 00:00:33.574
Plan controlled camera movement in Higgsfield, then trace the generation graph in ComfyUI.

6
00:00:33.574 --> 00:00:38.161
Keep the prompt, seed, sampler, and reference choices visible.

7
00:00:38.161 --> 00:00:41.292
Review the composite and color in Resolve.

8
00:00:41.692 --> 00:00:44.168
Adapt the work into motion campaign.

9
00:00:44.168 --> 00:00:52.559
Compare formats side by side, preview the movement, and review the final experience at the size people will actually see.
